4032-c) The host reads the Status or Alternate Status register until the BSY bit is equal to 0 and the DRDY bit is
4033-equal to 1;
4034-d) The host writes any required command parameters to the Features, Sector Count, Sector Number,
--
4055-          command execution is complete.
