4617-(4-3) Device drives IORDY low before tA: wait generated. The cycle completes after IORDY is reasserted. For cycles
4618-where a wait is generated and DIOR- is asserted, the device shall place read data on DD0-15 for tRD before causing
4619-IORDY to be asserted.
