    18: 
    19: ABSTRACT
    20: This standard defines an integrated interface between devices and host processors. It provides a common point of
    21: attachment for systems manufacturers, system integrators, and suppliers of intelligent devices.
    22: 
    23: ASC X3T10 Technical Editor:
