The literal `2 → 1` change removes offset 1 from WDC’s registration. These files do not establish every machine that attaches WDC or what its bus does afterward. There’s also a premise to correct: DD7 clear is a byte-value property; the draft requires DD7 to be undriven, which is not the same thing.

